# AFTER FIX — evidence for WE-20260528-004
# Captured: 2026-05-29

## Changes
- easebot-backend/.env.example: FRONTEND_BASE_URL default flipped 8080 → 8081
  with explanatory comment about Vite dev port + prod-required-ness.
- easebot-backend/src/controllers/paymentController.ts:
    + frontendBaseUrl() helper: env → dev fallback (:8081) → throw in prod.
    + handleReturn() switched from env('FRONTEND_BASE_URL') to frontendBaseUrl().
    + validatePaymentConfig() adds FRONTEND_BASE_URL to required list when
      NODE_ENV=production; logs a one-line warning in dev if unset.

## Live verification (standalone harness, ephemeral port)

Harness mounts a replica of the patched resolver + handleReturn's early
"bad_payload" redirect branch on a tiny Express app, fires POSTs, captures
the 302 Location header. Source: qa-harness/evidence/.../verify-source.mjs.

[dev, FRONTEND_BASE_URL unset (NEW fallback)]
  -> Location: http://localhost:8081/payment/failure?reason=bad_payload

[dev, FRONTEND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8081 (explicit)]
  -> Location: http://localhost:8081/payment/failure?reason=bad_payload

[dev, FRONTEND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080 (legacy override still honored)]
  -> Location: http://localhost:8080/payment/failure?reason=bad_payload

[prod, FRONTEND_BASE_URL=https://app.example.com]
  -> Location: https://app.example.com/payment/failure?reason=bad_payload

[prod, FRONTEND_BASE_URL unset]
  -> throws: missing env: FRONTEND_BASE_URL (validatePaymentConfig also exits at boot)

## Behaviour matrix

| NODE_ENV    | FRONTEND_BASE_URL set? | Result                                              |
|-------------|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
| development | no                     | falls back to http://localhost:8081 (no crash)      |
| development | yes (any URL)          | uses env value verbatim                             |
| production  | no                     | validatePaymentConfig() exits process at boot       |
| production  | yes                    | uses env value verbatim                             |

