## Production impact (zero, if env was set)

If an existing prod deploy already set FRONTEND_BASE_URL explicitly (as it
should, and as the .env.example comment now states), behavior is identical
to before this patch. The patch's prod-side change is purely defensive:
boot now fails fast if the env is missing, instead of waiting for the first
PayU return to crash mid-flight.
